        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-128" value="Allocate vehicle dynamics once: Gazebo may own land contact/dynamics, while OpenModelica owns allocated energy/controller models. For water, use a validated reduced plant derived from CFD. At handover, map state explicitly; do not let two&#10;solvers integrate the same degrees of freedom." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#20364B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
